sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Cluster Administrator
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant OLM as OLM<br/>Operator Lifecycle Manager
    participant CatSrc as CatalogSource<br/>redhat-operators
    participant Registry as Container Registry<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant CertMgr as cert-manager
    participant HookJob as Post-Install Hook Job

    rect rgb(255, 242, 204)
        Note over Admin,Registry: Flow 1: Kustomize Dependency Installation (OpenShift)
        Admin->>K8sAPI: kustomize build dependencies/ | oc apply<br/>HTTPS/6443, TLS 1.2+, kubeconfig
        K8sAPI->>OLM: Create Subscription CRs
        OLM->>CatSrc: Resolve operator bundles<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+
        OLM->>Registry: Pull operator images<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+, Pull Secret
        OLM-->>K8sAPI: Operator pods running
        Admin->>K8sAPI: kustomize build configurations/ | oc apply<br/>HTTPS/6443, TLS 1.2+, kubeconfig
        Note right of Admin: Phase 2: Post-CRD configs<br/>(Kueue, LWS, RHCL CRs)
    end

    rect rgb(213, 232, 212)
        Note over Admin,CertMgr: Flow 2: XKS Helm Chart Deployment
        Admin->>K8sAPI: helm install rhai-on-xks-chart<br/>HTTPS/6443, TLS 1.2+, kubeconfig
        K8sAPI->>Registry: Pull RHAI operator image<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+, Pull Secret
        K8sAPI-->>Admin: Resources created
        K8sAPI->>HookJob: Execute post-install hooks
        HookJob->>K8sAPI: Create Platform CR<br/>HTTPS/6443, ServiceAccount
        HookJob->>K8sAPI: Create Component CRs<br/>(KServe, AIGateway)
    end

    rect rgb(220, 232, 245)
        Note over HookJob,CertMgr: Flow 3: TLS Certificate Provisioning (XKS)
        HookJob->>CertMgr: Create rhai-ca Secret (CA keypair)
        HookJob->>K8sAPI: Create CA bundle ConfigMap
        HookJob->>CertMgr: Create Certificate CR<br/>(inference-gateway-cert)
        CertMgr-->>K8sAPI: Provision TLS Secret
        HookJob->>K8sAPI: Create Gateway CR with TLS ref
        Note right of HookJob: Gateway ready with<br/>cert-manager provisioned TLS
    end
